{"id":"4ffcd8be1ef80ce4","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-splitting-derivative-complexity.md","title":"导集的 Σ₂ 树表示","display":"lem-splitting-derivative-complexity — 导集的 Σ₂ 树表示","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-splitting-derivative-complexity","aliases":["20-lem-splitting-derivative-complexity"],"display":"lem-splitting-derivative-complexity — 导集的 Σ₂ 树表示","chapter":"8","section":"8.7","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercises 8.7.2, 8.7.4 的本地证明","source_printed_pages":[171,172],"source_pdf_pages":[204,205],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tree]]","[[20-df-extendible]]","[[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]","[[20-thm-konig]]","[[20-thm-rel-post]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-splitting-derivative-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-splitting-derivative-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-splitting-derivative-complexity — 导集的 Σ₂ 树表示"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercises 8.7.2, 8.7.4 的本地证明"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>171</span><span>172</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>204</span><span>205</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8705fb72e379b21a\" href=\"?note=8705fb72e379b21a\" title=\"20-df-extendible\">20-df-extendible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" href=\"?note=14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" title=\"20-df-cantor-bendixson\">20-df-cantor-bendixson</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b4c1ab1358773e54\" href=\"?note=b4c1ab1358773e54\" title=\"20-thm-konig\">20-thm-konig</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7315f2111b653872\" href=\"?note=7315f2111b653872\" title=\"20-thm-rel-post\">20-thm-rel-post</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是可计算树；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(X\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 版本则要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\le_T X\">\\(T\\le_T X\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S(T)=\\{\\sigma\\in T:\\exists\\rho,\\tau\\in T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\rho\\land\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\land\\rho\\perp\\tau]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S(T)=\\{\\sigma\\in T:\\exists\\rho,\\tau\\in T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\rho\\land\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\land\\rho\\perp\\tau]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8705fb72e379b21a\" href=\"?note=8705fb72e379b21a\" title=\"20-df-extendible\">20-df-extendible</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" href=\"?note=14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" title=\"20-df-cantor-bendixson\">20-df-cantor-bendixson</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b4c1ab1358773e54\" href=\"?note=b4c1ab1358773e54\" title=\"20-thm-konig\">20-thm-konig</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"7315f2111b653872\" href=\"?note=7315f2111b653872\" title=\"20-thm-rel-post\">20-thm-rel-post</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}splitting-derivative-complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Tree}_2(S(T))\\land[S(T)]=D([T])\\land S(T)\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}splitting-derivative-complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Tree}_2(S(T))\\land[S(T)]=D([T])\\land S(T)\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相对版本统一有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(T)\\le_T X&#39;&#39;\">\\(S(T)\\le_T X&#39;&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>分裂见证对任何父前缀仍有效，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(T)\">\\(S(T)\\)</span> 是树。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in S(T)\">\\(\\sigma\\in S(T)\\)</span> 恰表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T_\\sigma]\">\\([T_\\sigma]\\)</span> 至少有两个不同成员；König 引理把可延伸见证化为路径。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的每个前缀满足此性质当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 非孤立，故路径集为导集。</p>\n<p>对可计算二值树，可延伸性是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1\">\\(\\Pi^0_1\\)</span> 条件，存在一对有限不兼容可延伸节点是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_2\">\\(\\Sigma^0_2\\)</span> 条件；内层有限代码量化不增添层级。因此由相对 Post 定理，树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(T)\">\\(S(T)\\)</span> 可由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X&#39;&#39;\">\\(X&#39;&#39;\\)</span> 判定。这里的节点集合与删除有限路径柱的树可能不同，但它们的路径集相同；没有声称导集树本身仍可计算。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 171–172 / PDF 204–205。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tr