":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-thm-rel-post]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-rel-post","status":"resolved","id":"7315f2111b653872","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-thm-rel-post]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"T\\le_T X","display":false},{"tex":"S(T)=\\{\\sigma\\in T:\\exists\\rho,\\tau\\in T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\rho\\land\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\land\\rho\\perp\\tau]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}splitting-derivative-complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Tree}_2(S(T))\\land[S(T)]=D([T])\\land S(T)\\le_T\\varnothing''.","display":true},{"tex":"S(T)\\le_T X''","display":false},{"tex":"S(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in S(T)","display":false},{"tex":"[T_\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_2","display":false},{"tex":"S(T)","display":false},{"tex":"X''","display":false}],"bytes":1988,"backlinks":[{"id":"fecd9d857d0daf42","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-lem-splitting-derivative-complexity]]。"}],"outgoing":["93a810534b87b0f9","8705fb72e379b21a","14fc2af0ac27dcbb","b4c1ab1358773e54","7315f2111b653872"]}